OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to refurbish Guildhall
OL,4,ATheatre approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to refurbish the Guildhall
OL,7,FTheatre in Derby have been given the
OL,8,Fgo-ahead.
OL,10,FDerby City Council's planning control
OL,11,Fcommittee approved two planning
OL,12,Fapplications on Thursday for the
OL,13,Frenovation of the Grade II listed
OL,14,Fbuilding.
OL,16,FThe venue, which dates back to the
OL,17,F1820s, closed in January 2019 due to
OL,18,Fissues with the condition of the roof
OL,19,Fand ceiling in the auditorium.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
